    <characterLearnPoints>
      <Value><![CDATA[{"contentData":[{"contentTypeKey":"e1a00005-0000-0000-0000-000000000005","key":"d0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000009","values":[{"culture":null,"editorAlias":"Umbraco.TextBox","alias":"accordionTitle","value":"Courage and Confidence","segment":null},{"culture":null,"editorAlias":"Umbraco.RichText","alias":"accordionContent","value":"<p>Milo shows that being brave means trying even when it's hard.</p>","segment":null}]},{"contentTypeKey":"e1a00005-0000-0000-0000-000000000005","key":"d0000000-0000-0000-0000-00000000000a","values":[{"culture":null,"editorAlias":"Umbraco.TextBox","alias":"accordionTitle","value":"Working Together","segment":null},{"culture":null,"editorAlias":"Umbraco.RichText","alias":"accordionContent","value":"<p>He brings friends together to solve problems as a team.</p>","segment":null}]},{"contentTypeKey":"e1a00005-0000-0000-0000-000000000005","key":"d0000000-0000-0000-0000-00000000000b","values":[{"culture":null,"editorAlias":"Umbraco.TextBox","alias":"accordionTitle","value":"Staying Positive","segment":null},{"culture":null,"editorAlias":"Umbraco.RichText","alias":"accordionContent","value":"<p>A big smile and a can-do attitude carry Milo through any setback.</p>","segment":null}]},{"contentTypeKey":"e1a00005-0000-0000-0000-000000000005","key":"d0000000-0000-0000-0000-00000000000c","values":[{"culture":null,"editorAlias":"Umbraco.TextBox","alias":"accordionTitle","value":"Leading with Heart","segment":null},{"culture":null,"editorAlias":"Umbraco.RichText","alias":"accordionContent","value":"<p>Milo leads by cheering others on and sharing every win.</p>","segment":null}]}],"settingsData":[],"layout":{"Umbraco.BlockList":[{"contentKey":"d0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000009"},{"contentKey":"d0000000-0000-0000-0000-00000000000a"},{"contentKey":"d0000000-0000-0000-0000-00000000000b"},{"contentKey":"d0000000-0000-0000-0000-00000000000c"}]},"expose":[{"culture":null,"contentKey":"d0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000009","segment":nu